I'm trying to use the ShrinkWrap Resolver for Gradle with Java 10.0.2 and Gradle 4.9. Unfortunately, I get following error: {{Could not determine java version from '10.0.2'.}} as soon as I call:

{code:java}
ShrinkWrap.create(EmbeddedGradleImporter.class).forThisProjectDirectory().importBuildOutput().as(WebArchive.class);
{code}

I guess the used Gradle Tooling API in 3.1.3 is outdated, as you can see in [pom.xml|https://github.com/shrinkwrap/resolver/blob/master/pom.xml]. Also I would like to point out, that the Tooling API will be removed in [Gradle 5.0|https://docs.gradle.org/current/userguide/embedding.html#java_version].

